WEBVTT

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:11.671
Man, it's cold! I've been freezing
my ass off for the past 2-3 days!

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.736
Bring me the man in charge!

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.809
You might as well get
used to it. It's winter!

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:19.978
On a day like this, it's best
to eat something piping hot...

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:22.351
...to warm you up from the inside!

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.291
Now THAT'S what I call
a plan, Cherry"

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.917
Now that it's come to this...

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:28.222
Now that it's come to this...?

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.989
We'll all drink gasoline!!

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.631
ARE YOU TRYING TO KILL ME?!!
Sukiyaki! We need sukiyaki!!

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.602
WE WILL HAVE SUKIYAKI™

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:41.440
Sukiyaki?

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:08.128
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:11.732
| was born to be with you.

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:15.075
The moment I awoke...

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:19.167
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:22.781
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:26.441
I was born to hold you.

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:29.589
Lies and truths...

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:33.751
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:38.495
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.333
...won't get to me.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:43.862
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:47.430
...can be ours once again!

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:51.971
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:55.913
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:59.282
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:04.017
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:27.612
Now the Earth is too far away
to see with the naked eye.

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:33.217
Hey!

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.211
Are you thinking about Earth, too?

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:40.149
The Mesopotamia will be leaving
the solar system soon...

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.092
Oh, sorry! I'm leyasu.

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:45.154
Ieyasu Tokugawa. And you?

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:48.294
Faust Gelhardt.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.665
This is Dr. Lorelei.

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:59.679
Dr. Lorelei? The child prodigy?!

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:02.215
I read your thesis! My gosh!

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:06.376
Who had any idea that the authority
on fractal geometry was such a beauty!

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:08.854
I'm very happy to meet you!

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:19.831
Lorelei...

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:25.329
Revival Of The Females?!
The Mystery Of Lorelei

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:43.647
Sukiyaki, sukiyaki! Oh, what fun!

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:47.387
Quit singing it out, wouldja?
It's embarrassing!

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:51.091
But I've never had sukiyaki before!

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:54.361
| wonder what it tastes like?
Maybe it's like fish cake!

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:58.098
It's a meat dish,
so it's probably like a stew!

00:03:58.638 --> 00:04:00.106
Okay, okay...

00:04:00.173 --> 00:04:03.143
All right, let's split up
and buy the ingredients!

00:04:03.209 --> 00:04:04.040
Yo!

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.378
"Butcher Shop"
Excuse me!

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:09.574
One kilogram of
boned beef, please!

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:12.050
Hi, Lime! You're
as cute as always!

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:13.517
Yup, I sure am!

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:15.577
Here you are!
One kilo of prime sirloin!

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:18.124
Huh?! I asked for boned beef.

00:04:18.891 --> 00:04:20.381
My treat.

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:22.962
Thanks!

00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:26.028
Here you go! Tofu, enoki,
and shiitake mushrooms!

00:04:26.199 --> 00:04:28.600
And this is something
for you, Cherry!

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:30.500
Thank you so much!

00:04:31.004 --> 00:04:33.974
Here you are! Chinese cabbage, crown
daisies, long onions, carrots, and...

00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:37.736
...For a smile, I'll let you keep
the small change, Bloodberry!

00:04:39.379 --> 00:04:40.904
Hey, thanks again!

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:43.675
Those three are really
starting to fit in!

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.548
Otaru...

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.116
H-Hanagata!

00:04:48.187 --> 00:04:51.589
Otaru, you mustn't
leave out the shirataki!

00:04:51.658 --> 00:04:52.557
Shirataki?

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:56.255
Shirataki noodles are my most
favorite ingredient in sukiyaki!

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:59.929
Their glossy, pure white skins!
Their slimy edibility!

00:04:59.999 --> 00:05:01.694
Their indistinct flavor!

00:05:01.768 --> 00:05:05.363
Oh, Shirataki!
Why for art thou Shirataki?

00:05:06.706 --> 00:05:08.140
Master Mitsurugi!

00:05:08.207 --> 00:05:10.733
We've been looking for you, Master!

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:14.075
Your father is furious with you
for not coming home on New Year's!

00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:17.173
He didn't even let me know that
the Joshuya had been restored.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.740
Like he has the right.

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:22.277
But, he cleared off all
of your debts, Master!

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:25.920
Oh! So THAT'S why the collectors
have been leaving me alone!

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:27.721
Still, I can't make it today.

00:05:27.794 --> 00:05:30.572
I have been invited
to a sukiyaki party!

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:32.086
Nobody invited you!

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:34.497
We shall gather around
the bubbling pot...

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:37.332
...and swap stories of youth
until dawn, Otaru!

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:40.139
Hey, you! Unhand me!

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:43.176
- If you'll excuse us!
- Shirataki, shirataki! My shirataki!

00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:48.011
Sukiyaki, sukiyaki! Oh, what fun!

00:05:48.381 --> 00:05:50.213
Sukiyaki, sukiyaki! Oh, what fun!

00:05:50.283 --> 00:05:54.049
Quit it with the singing already"
It's like shouting out that we're poor!

00:05:54.354 --> 00:05:58.018
We're poor, we're poor! Oh, how sad!

00:05:58.591 --> 00:06:02.289
We're poor, we're poor! Oh, how sad!

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:13.172
Look out™

00:06:24.617 --> 00:06:25.140
OTARUM

00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:26.310
Master Otarul

00:06:26.719 --> 00:06:28.744
- Otaru, are you okay?!
- Master Otaru!

00:06:28.821 --> 00:06:30.289
Are you all right, Otaru?!

00:06:31.924 --> 00:06:33.653
Knock that off, it tickles!

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:41.926
M-Master Otaru...

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:44.598
"Fuji ya Sweet Shoppe”

00:06:45.638 --> 00:06:48.039
Sweet beans, sweet beans.
Oh, what fun...

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:49.768
YOU IDIOT!!

00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:53.337
What the hell was going on in your
heads?! A little puppy was about...

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:57.008
...to get run over, right in front of
you, yet all you could do was stare!!

00:06:57.683 --> 00:06:59.173
I'm sorry...

00:06:59.252 --> 00:07:01.846
If apologies could make things all
better, we wouldn't need court houses!

00:07:01.921 --> 00:07:06.017
<i>Geez! What stopped you
from saving W1 EX?</i>

00:07:06.159 --> 00:07:09.094
I'm sorry, Master Otaru.
But, to save the puppy...

00:07:09.162 --> 00:07:13.190
...I would have had to drop the
sukiyaki fixings, so I became confused.

00:07:13.266 --> 00:07:14.756
| got confused, too.

00:07:15.968 --> 00:07:18.164
What are you SAYING?!

00:07:18.237 --> 00:07:21.366
What do you think is more important?!
The sukiyaki or a puppy's LIFE?!

00:07:22.141 --> 00:07:23.006
Life?

00:07:23.075 --> 00:07:24.702
The sukiyaki, of course!!

00:07:25.645 --> 00:07:28.546
B-Bloodberry...
What did you just say?

00:07:28.981 --> 00:07:31.313
| said that the sukiyaki
is more important.

00:07:31.384 --> 00:07:35.014
To be more precise: the sukiyaki
that you're going to eat.

00:07:35.087 --> 00:07:38.717
Listen, Otaru. The most important
thing in the world to me is you.

00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:42.728
| couldn't stand it if you had
to eat food with mud on it.

00:07:43.329 --> 00:07:46.458
| would do anything
at all to please you.

00:07:47.467 --> 00:07:52.166
| am here, at this moment, for YOU!
That, I'd like you to understand, Otaru.

00:07:53.072 --> 00:07:56.906
Don't worry, Master Otaru! I have
recorded the data from this experience...

00:07:56.976 --> 00:07:59.877
...so I won't make that
mistake ever again!

00:07:59.946 --> 00:08:01.436
Me too, Otaru!

00:08:02.715 --> 00:08:04.240
Hey...

00:08:04.317 --> 00:08:07.252
Isn't it getting through to you?

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.258
We are sorry to disturb
your pleasant conversation...

00:08:16.662 --> 00:08:18.721
...but we need to
speak with Mr. Otaru.

00:08:19.732 --> 00:08:21.700
Wh-Who's there?! Where are you?!

00:08:25.638 --> 00:08:27.106
8-Since when?!

00:08:27.773 --> 00:08:31.141
Mr. Otaru Mamiya,
we are here to relay a message.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:35.738
Our Lord, Shogun leyasu Tokugawa,
says that he would like to see you.

00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:38.207
The Shogun?!

00:08:48.895 --> 00:08:50.385
Soemon.

00:08:51.898 --> 00:08:53.909
Please excuse my long silence.

00:08:53.933 --> 00:08:57.528
To think that you were
the one who trained Otaru...

00:08:57.603 --> 00:09:00.937
Perhaps this was also fate...

00:09:05.378 --> 00:09:07.403
Would you like to become stronger?

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.641
Yes.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.120
He was too kind to become strong.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:18.347
But, isn't his kindness
actually his strength?

00:09:21.627 --> 00:09:24.119
"JAPONESS PIONEER MUSEUM"

00:09:29.335 --> 00:09:30.803
Otaru, what is this?

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.668
The Japoness Pioneer Museum.

00:09:32.738 --> 00:09:35.537
This is the place where me
and Otaru first met!

00:09:35.608 --> 00:09:37.098
Yeah!

00:09:40.513 --> 00:09:42.003
Otaru's still mad.

00:09:43.482 --> 00:09:45.450
"Japoness Pioneer Museum”

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.685
Shogun!

00:09:48.754 --> 00:09:50.813
Grampa! It's Grampa!

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.119
Grampa, Grampa!!

00:09:52.191 --> 00:09:55.889
Oh, Lime! Long time, no see!
How are you?

00:09:55.962 --> 00:09:57.828
Actually, I'm not doing very well!!

00:09:57.897 --> 00:10:00.127
It's good to see you, Shogun!

00:10:00.199 --> 00:10:04.193
Otaru, Cherry, Bloodberry"
I'm glad to see you all in good health!

00:10:05.004 --> 00:10:07.405
And you especially, Shogun.

00:10:07.473 --> 00:10:10.534
Yes... I'm sorry for causing everyone
so much worry, but as you can see, I...

00:10:13.312 --> 00:10:14.438
LIME!

00:10:21.053 --> 00:10:23.613
Th-This is a human woman...?

00:10:23.689 --> 00:10:25.088
She's so pretty!

00:10:25.157 --> 00:10:28.616
This is in memory of the
human female, "Lorelei."

00:10:28.694 --> 00:10:30.662
She looks kind of like Cherry.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.664
But her expression is just like Lime's.

00:10:32.732 --> 00:10:34.826
Her face looks like Bloodberry's...!

00:10:42.174 --> 00:10:45.109
Master Otaru is making
puppy eyes at her!

00:10:45.177 --> 00:10:47.908
Now, now! You're only allowed
to fall in love with me!

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:52.076
Forget the woman in the picture,
and look at me instead!

00:10:52.151 --> 00:10:54.711
Otaru, Otaru, Otaru!
Me, me, me!!!

00:10:55.588 --> 00:10:58.683
Be quiet!!
You three, go wait outside!!

00:11:02.662 --> 00:11:04.426
Those guys...!

00:11:05.631 --> 00:11:07.599
You certainly are popular
with the ladies, Otaru!

00:11:11.237 --> 00:11:13.205
Otaru's really mad.

00:11:21.247 --> 00:11:24.581
Oh, is that what happened!
Puppies and sukiyaki!

00:11:25.651 --> 00:11:29.212
It's nothing to laugh about!
I'm still in shock over it.

00:11:30.222 --> 00:11:32.520
Now, don't be so hard on them.

00:11:32.591 --> 00:11:35.526
They give their best for their master,
and their master comes first.

00:11:35.594 --> 00:11:37.653
That is how marionettes
have always been.

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:41.894
That may be true, but don't they
have those maiden circuit things?

00:11:42.601 --> 00:11:45.229
If so, they should have
the same emotions as humans.

00:11:46.572 --> 00:11:48.597
You will find the answer
to that in due time.

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:55.748
Hey!

00:11:57.683 --> 00:11:59.651
The capsule where Lime was sleeping!

00:12:01.253 --> 00:12:03.449
Otaru, come this way.

00:12:03.522 --> 00:12:05.012
Coming, sir.

00:12:07.626 --> 00:12:09.890
This is what I wanted to show you.

00:12:13.933 --> 00:12:16.698
WW... What? Hey...!

00:12:32.985 --> 00:12:34.783
As you instructed, Lord Faust...

00:12:34.854 --> 00:12:38.154
...I have issued Goddel and the saber
dolls the order to return to base.

00:12:38.224 --> 00:12:40.556
Rubens is standing by.

00:12:40.626 --> 00:12:41.855
And the Sabelberg?

00:12:41.927 --> 00:12:44.259
Everything is proceeding
right on schedule.

00:12:47.133 --> 00:12:49.602
Will you use it to attack Japoness?

00:12:49.668 --> 00:12:52.729
No, it would first be amusing
to shake up leyasu.

00:12:56.642 --> 00:12:58.132
W-What?

00:12:58.677 --> 00:13:01.271
Shogun, what is that?

00:13:02.681 --> 00:13:06.345
This is a machine that measures
the growth of the maiden circuits.

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:12.219
Lime is at 56%, Cherry, 65,
and Bloodberry, 58.

00:13:12.558 --> 00:13:15.584
All three are growing
right on schedule.

00:13:15.661 --> 00:13:19.256
G-Growing?! Are you saying
that they are GROWING?

00:13:19.331 --> 00:13:22.961
Yes. You may as well refer to their
maiden circuits as their "hearts."

00:13:23.536 --> 00:13:25.903
Those with hearts
grow on a daily basis.

00:13:26.338 --> 00:13:30.241
...I don't believe it!
Marionettes can't GROW!

00:13:30.709 --> 00:13:32.700
Who are you?

00:13:34.647 --> 00:13:37.742
Otaru! I love Otaru!

00:13:39.852 --> 00:13:42.150
Is she growing?

00:13:46.659 --> 00:13:48.787
This was mostly your fault,
Bloodberry!

00:13:48.861 --> 00:13:50.829
You shouldn't have
said all that to him!

00:13:50.896 --> 00:13:52.625
Yeah, whatever!
You're the one...

00:13:52.698 --> 00:13:54.928
...that was nodding her head
like a yes-yes girl!

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.968
I didn't nod MY head!

00:13:57.903 --> 00:13:58.995
LIAR!

00:14:03.342 --> 00:14:05.572
I think they're arguing.

00:14:05.644 --> 00:14:07.408
| can't leave them
alone for a minute!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.745
Shogun.

00:14:09.815 --> 00:14:11.408
What's wrong, Otaru?

00:14:11.483 --> 00:14:13.645
Please tell me! Why?
Why are your marionettes...

00:14:13.719 --> 00:14:16.814
Marionettes that GROW...
...all coming to me?

00:14:16.889 --> 00:14:18.584
And, why THREE?

00:14:18.657 --> 00:14:21.957
There's gotta be SOME sort
of a good reason for it!

00:14:23.729 --> 00:14:25.197
Shogun!

00:14:26.999 --> 00:14:28.262
Very well...

00:14:28.334 --> 00:14:31.031
It seems the time
has come to tell you.

00:14:32.638 --> 00:14:36.199
The truth is, Otaru... You and
those three saber marionettes...

00:14:36.275 --> 00:14:39.973
...are the hope of all
mankind on Terra ll.

00:14:40.646 --> 00:14:42.171
Th-The hope of all mankind?!

00:14:42.248 --> 00:14:45.809
Yes... The revival
of the human female!

00:14:52.825 --> 00:14:55.157
Th-The revival of the female?!

00:14:55.861 --> 00:15:00.697
With man and woman, mankind
will regain its true shape.

00:15:01.166 --> 00:15:03.828
This male-only planet of
Terra ll is highly unusual.

00:15:04.303 --> 00:15:07.068
Man meets woman,
they fall in love...

00:15:07.139 --> 00:15:09.972
...and eventually, they leave
the future with their children.

00:15:10.643 --> 00:15:15.638
Without the revival of the female,
Terra ll has no such future!

00:15:15.714 --> 00:15:17.239
But, can we do that?!

00:15:17.316 --> 00:15:19.284
We can. Yes, we can!

00:15:19.351 --> 00:15:23.447
When those three have grown to the
fullest they can through your "love..."

00:15:24.223 --> 00:15:25.622
...the female...

00:15:25.691 --> 00:15:28.092
...the human female
will be restored!

00:15:48.247 --> 00:15:50.306
Reviving the human female?

00:15:51.283 --> 00:15:54.275
Argh! I'm still having
trouble understanding this!

00:16:00.726 --> 00:16:04.356
It would seem that leyasu the First
was in love with her!

00:16:06.432 --> 00:16:10.460
I'm the 15th, so I don't
have any solid memories...

00:16:10.536 --> 00:16:14.131
...but her smile is like
a breath of heaven for me.

00:16:14.707 --> 00:16:16.266
I like this picture, too.

00:16:17.676 --> 00:16:20.202
That would make us rivals.

00:16:34.193 --> 00:16:34.751
What the?!

00:16:39.331 --> 00:16:39.889
Otaru!

00:16:39.965 --> 00:16:40.625
Master Otaru!

00:16:40.699 --> 00:16:42.189
OTARU!

00:16:50.709 --> 00:16:52.677
Shogun, come on!
Let's get out of here!!

00:16:57.049 --> 00:16:58.517
Look out!

00:17:00.052 --> 00:17:01.520
Crap!

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:09.887
Otarul

00:17:11.663 --> 00:17:13.597
Otaru!

00:17:13.665 --> 00:17:15.724
Lime! Cherry! Bloodberry!

00:17:16.435 --> 00:17:18.904
- Come, Master Otaru! Quickly!
- I'll take the old man!

00:17:18.971 --> 00:17:20.439
Right!

00:17:25.878 --> 00:17:28.108
Are you hurt, Master Otaru?

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:31.480
I'm fine. How's the Shogun?

00:17:44.763 --> 00:17:47.630
The picture...
Lorelei's picture...!

00:17:51.737 --> 00:17:53.637
Shogun! What are you doing?!

00:17:53.705 --> 00:17:57.573
Let go of me, Otaru!! The picture!
The picture will be burned!

00:17:58.343 --> 00:18:02.302
Lorelei's picture...!
The treasure of my soul!!

00:18:03.849 --> 00:18:06.079
Don't! It's too late, sir!!

00:18:25.704 --> 00:18:27.468
Grampa...

00:18:36.849 --> 00:18:38.613
Otaru, can| go?

00:18:39.751 --> 00:18:42.652
| want to go get his treasure!

00:18:42.721 --> 00:18:44.189
Lime?!

00:18:47.359 --> 00:18:48.793
Y...You guys!

00:18:53.432 --> 00:18:54.797
ALL RIGHT...

00:18:54.867 --> 00:18:57.234
GO GET IT!!

00:19:16.955 --> 00:19:18.423
Now, quickly!

00:19:24.496 --> 00:19:26.726
Lime, go ahead without me!

00:19:26.798 --> 00:19:28.266
Right!

00:20:02.601 --> 00:20:04.763
I'm sorry, Grampa...

00:20:19.685 --> 00:20:24.054
Thank you!
Lime, Cherry, Bloodberry!!

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.918
I've lost Lorelei's picture...

00:20:27.993 --> 00:20:31.361
...but I've gained an even more
wonderful treasure in its place!

00:20:35.834 --> 00:20:37.666
THREE wonderful treasures!

00:20:42.941 --> 00:20:44.466
| couldn't be happier!

00:20:44.543 --> 00:20:46.637
They decided to do it
all by themselves!!

00:20:46.712 --> 00:20:48.646
I'm proud of you guys!

00:20:49.848 --> 00:20:52.545
Otaru is proud of us... Why?

00:20:52.618 --> 00:20:54.108
Who knows?

00:20:55.187 --> 00:20:56.621
Shogun.

00:20:56.688 --> 00:20:59.248
What should I do now?

00:20:59.324 --> 00:21:03.227
| can't make heads or tails
of this female reviving business.

00:21:03.295 --> 00:21:05.229
And, even if I could,
what should I do?

00:21:05.697 --> 00:21:07.256
Just carry on as you were.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.690
Carry on?

00:21:10.235 --> 00:21:12.795
They are growing well.

00:21:13.305 --> 00:21:16.570
Very well. Let them continue
to grow, and someday...

00:21:28.887 --> 00:21:31.322
Faust, the fuhrer of Gartlant,
has all of the memories...

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:35.156
...of Faust the First
perfectly intact. His ambitions...

00:21:35.227 --> 00:21:37.628
...his pain, and his sadness...

00:22:04.323 --> 00:22:08.055
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:08.126 --> 00:22:11.790
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:14.831
Just think of me...

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:19.462
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:19.705 --> 00:22:23.471
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:23.542 --> 00:22:27.172
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:27.346 --> 00:22:31.078
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:31.149 --> 00:22:32.913
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:32.984 --> 00:22:36.943
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:39.024 --> 00:22:41.356
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:41.426 --> 00:22:46.387
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:46.565 --> 00:22:50.160
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:50.402 --> 00:22:54.032
...one step at a time.

00:22:54.239 --> 00:22:57.937
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:58.009 --> 00:23:01.741
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:01.913 --> 00:23:05.406
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:05.784 --> 00:23:11.746
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:20.665 --> 00:23:21.894
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:21.967 --> 00:23:24.493
I made friends with "Squirrely,"
a squirrel from the forest.

00:23:24.569 --> 00:23:26.594
But, Otaru says to go put
him back in the forest...

00:23:26.671 --> 00:23:28.639
...because he makes too much
trouble for everybody.

00:23:28.707 --> 00:23:31.938
I won't, I won't, I won't!!
I don't want to get rid of him!

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.274
Oh? Squirrely stopped moving.

00:23:34.346 --> 00:23:36.747
Hey, Otaru? Will
you fix him for me?

00:23:36.815 --> 00:23:39.716
If he gets repaired like us,
he'll work again, right?

00:23:40.719 --> 00:23:44.713
What's A "Living Thing"?
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:46.781
I love you, Otaru!!
